# Testing Rules

Author: slspencer
Copyright: 2026

## Scope

Applies to unit/integration/UI verification practices.

## Rules

- Add or update tests when behavior changes.
- Prefer targeted tests close to the changed module.
- Keep tests deterministic and environment-independent.
- Validate regressions for bug-fix changes.
- Avoid over-mocking core geometry/layout logic.

## Verification Guidance

- Run the smallest relevant test set first, then broaden.
- For docs-only changes, verify links/paths and references.
